{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/5734902a0db2258e8070186ae2b6ee27.poster.avif?t=1773780272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/5734902a0db2258e8070186ae2b6ee27.webm?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/5734902a0db2258e8070186ae2b6ee27.mp4?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your Conquest ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide which objectives you want to explore along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare your defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/e71e5e77a08d24d7f03402406b660a36.poster.avif?t=1773780272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/e71e5e77a08d24d7f03402406b660a36.webm?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/e71e5e77a08d24d7f03402406b660a36.mp4?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Tower Cards to build strong defense against approaching waves of enemies.<br>Each next wave is more powerful than previous one, so remember to upgrade your Towers to their full potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare your offense</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/fec486e62c5c6253c7137b4161719ab3.poster.avif?t=1773780272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/fec486e62c5c6253c7137b4161719ab3.webm?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/fec486e62c5c6253c7137b4161719ab3.mp4?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Unit Cards to recruit troops and create your own offensive waves. <br>Your opponent will defend himself with all his might, combine various types of units effectively to reach the target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find balance </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one resource for Units and Towers - think wisely when spending it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the enemies breach your defenses and create powerful enough offensive to breach their defenses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells are the Ace in the Sleeve - they provide utilities such as restoring resources, drawing more Cards or shuffling your Hand. Be cautious - you can use only one Spell during battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/d62a7fe7d53cff3dc90db8370ae5694d.poster.avif?t=1773780272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/d62a7fe7d53cff3dc90db8370ae5694d.webm?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/d62a7fe7d53cff3dc90db8370ae5694d.mp4?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Relics from fallen Enemy Camps to enhance your Towers, Units or weaken your enemies. Relics come in various rarities, on your travels you may find Altars where you can sacrifice Relics to receive ones with higher rarity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your own Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon defeating your enemies you will receive Gold, the further you manage to travel - the more Gold you will find. Use it to unlock new Cards, find creative ways to combine them and create Decks that will allow you to reach places previously inaccessible.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883580?t=1773780272","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/ed9f4b1fb95fcd3ee1861666172017edd0e77730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773780272","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/04bd77f330380a4692afc338ebe74a46e63bc354/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773780272","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/04bd77f330380a4692afc338ebe74a46e63bc354/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773780272","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4160790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/5734902a0db2258e8070186ae2b6ee27.poster.avif?t=1773780272\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883580/extras/5734902a0db2258e8070186ae2b6ee27.webm?t=1773780272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source